    "evidence": "The confrontational “Accuracy is the wrong question” thesis, evaluation-ledger framing, cyan/red defense-console palette, and evidence-oriented labels give the screen a recognizable identity across all viewports. However, most of the body remains familiar dark-dashboard material: KPI tiles, standard charts, a matrix, and a table. No visible interaction or singular visual device turns the metrics into a memorable demo moment.",
